{"id":"469133","name":"西红柿鸡蛋汤","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/469133/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"两个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西红柿两个洗净。","img":"images/469133/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小块儿。","img":"images/469133/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"两个鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/469133/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅凉油，放入葱姜末，虾皮炝锅，放入西红柿块儿。","img":"images/469133/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"爆出香味儿翻炒一会儿。","img":"images/469133/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入适量清水烧开，加少许盐。","img":"images/469133/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水淀粉鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/469133/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将鸡蛋打散成蛋液。","img":"images/469133/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将鸡蛋液缓缓淋入锅中依次倒入小火烧开。","img":"images/469133/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"淋入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/469133/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/469133/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒入少许韭菜叶提香。","img":"images/469133/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/469133/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/469133/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}